<title>UK: BOE buys 750 mln stg in repo, outright bills.</title>
<headline>BOE buys 750 mln stg in repo, outright bills.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of England bought 750 million stg in outright bills and repos to help offset an estimated money market shortage of 1.3 billion stg.</p>
<p>The central bank bought 83 million stg of bills outright and 667 million in repos to July 28.</p>
<p>The central bank said it had now provided 1.3 billion stg of total assistance to the money markets today.</p>
</text>
